tweet_count":0},"text":"死装哥究竟有多装呢，就是分手是因为说感觉我在他的生活中占比太重了，他不想要这种失控感，我觉得这种分手理由对我来说就是告诉我还有机会，于是我就死乞白赖缠着他求复合，因为比我大一些，而且成绩真的很好的理科男啊，所以我会一直缠着他给我讲一些题目","url":"https://x.com/kiloku030/status/2110845559234064543"},{"article":{"title":"16 个「完整交易系统 / Agent」实测：11 万星的 TradingAgents 21 分，没有一个跑通 paper 闭环（5/5）"},"author_id":"896204154506366977","created_at":"2026-10-17T03:42:49.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111301883255988387"],"id":"2111301883255988387","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":1683,"like_count":8,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":3,"retweet_count":3},"text":"https://t.co/Pq5CxKvMPf","url":"https://x.com/xparkzz/status/2111301883255988387"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2111484032106246145"]},"author_id":"1786121413767938048","created_at":"2026-10-17T15:47:48.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111484330791104919"],"id":"2111484330791104919","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":59,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"現在禪一字已經被濫用了，某種感覺，某種庭院的擺設，\n某種畫風，都用禪來描述了，那麼什麼是真正的禪呢？\n\n《六祖壇經·坐禪品第五》説：\n\n「何名坐禪？此法門中，無障無礙，外於一切善惡境界，心念不起，名為坐；內見自性不動，名為禪。」\n\n紧接着六祖又问：\n「何名禪定？」 https://t.co/Rp359xIUgz","url":"https://x.com/Tylertruthfx/status/2111484330791104919"},{"author_id":"209431348","created_at":"2026-10-16T13:30:42.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111087439955845385"],"id":"2111087439955845385","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":20,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"今天又是学习缠论的一天","url":"https://x.com/r_ranggra/status/2111087439955845385"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2111036631591337984"]},"author_id":"1544949349393874947","created_at":"2026-10-16T10:09:45.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111036636364480963","2111036870884741284","2111037519353479509"],"id":"2111036870884741284","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":77,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"威科夫理论（Wyckoff Method）和道氏理论（Dow Theory）才是现代缠论等众多本土化交易理论的两大底层基石。对于绝大多数交易初学者而言，先学位科夫理论，再看“缠论”，才是一条更符合逻辑、也更容易理解的进化路径。 https://t.co/l4wGsyVv2J","url":"https://x.com/julianne_prada/status/2111036870884741284"},{"author_id":"1006745743435198465","created_at":"2026-10-16T01:16:32.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110902682726875246"],"id":"2110902682726875246","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":6,"impression_count":1422,"like_count":14,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":12,"retweet_count":4},"text":"缠论高手与普通散户的区别：\n\n新低不是买点，背驰才值得关注？\n\n很多人炒股，看到股价不断创新低，就开始觉得：\n\n跌这么多了，该反弹了吧？\n已经破位了，是不是最后一跌？\n\n但从缠论的角度看，这恰恰是最容易犯的错误。\n\n破新低，只能说明价格更低了，并不能证明下跌已经结束。","url":"https://x.com/GPYZZY/status/2110902682726875246"},{"article":{"title":"开拓者的香艳旅行，色鬼穹宝只是度假就约到淫熟魅女爻光？被大姐姐摁着榨到喊妈妈，最后再反杀(星穹铁道)"},"author_id":"2204879139","created_at":"2026-10-15T22:52:11.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110866352357384500"],"id":"2110866352357384500","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":14,"impression_count":50051,"like_count":32,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":18,"retweet_count":4},"text":"https://t.co/jNcAUNQRhF","url":"https://x.com/ssss2t/status/2110866352357384500"}],"includes":{"media":[{"media_key":"3_2111037873533444096","type":"photo"},{"media_key":"3_2110839739100110850","type":"photo"},{"media_key":"3_2111407614277865472","type":"photo"},{"media_key":"3_2110908566295261184","type":"photo"},{"media_key":"3_2111036631591337984","type":"photo"},{"media_key":"3_2111533612000817152","type":"photo"},{"media_key":"3_2111533620339068928","type":"photo"},{"media_key":"3_2111484032106246145","type":"photo"}],"users":[{"id":"925446092669489154","name":"Peter Liu, PhD｜Wealth & Wellness","username":"InGodWeBelieveU"},{"id":"896204154506366977","name":"Park","username":"xparkzz"},{"id":"1713359202465251328","name":"Bored zz","username":"zhou1492987"},{"id":"1685620377941364736","name":"万倍基哥","username":"zhishuzengzhang"},{"id":"1879736704128716800","name":"與佛同行 Walking with the Buddha","username":"sun780500"},{"id":"1891330878393167872","name":"心灵书舫 | SoulSloop"